#: templates/landing.html:3
msgid ""
"Centropic — Signal Intelligence per Generative Engine Optimization: "
"diagnosi del dominio, artifact machine-readable e citabilità nelle "
"risposte IA."
msgstr ""
"Centropic — Signal Intelligence for Generative Engine Optimization: "
"domain diagnosis, machine-readable artifacts, and citability in AI "
"responses."

#: templates/landing.html:34
msgid ""
"Diagnostichiamo i segnali pubblici del dominio e consegniamo artifact "
"machine-readable per la citabilità nelle risposte di ChatGPT, Claude e "
"Perplexity."
msgstr ""
"We diagnose the public signals of the domain and deliver machine-readable"
" artifacts for citability in the responses of ChatGPT, Claude, and "
"Perplexity."

#: templates/landing.html:37
msgid "Avvia la diagnosi"
msgstr "Start the diagnosis"

#: templates/landing.html:38
msgid "Scopri il metodo"
msgstr "Discover the method"

#: templates/landing.html:44
msgid "Contesto"
msgstr "Context"

#: templates/landing.html:45
msgid ""
"I modelli generativi citano ciò che è chiaro, strutturato e machine-"
"readable."
msgstr "Generative models cite what is clear, structured, and machine-readable."

#: templates/landing.html:47
msgid ""
"Le risposte degli answer engine influenzano confronti e raccomandazioni "
"di brand. Centropic valuta i segnali del sito rispetto a AI-Driven "
"Visibility (AIO) e Generative Engine Optimization (GEO), identifica i gap"
" e produce gli artifact da mettere online. Non è un GIS cartografico né "
"una piattaforma All-in-One generica."
msgstr ""
"The responses of answer engines influence brand comparisons and "
"recommendations. Centropic evaluates site signals against AI-Driven "
"Visibility (AIO) and Generative Engine Optimization (GEO), identifies "
"gaps, and produces artifacts to be put online. It is not a cartographic "
"GIS nor a generic All-in-One platform."

#: templates/landing.html:52
msgid "Metodo"
msgstr "Method"

#: templates/landing.html:53
msgid "Tre fasi. Output operativo per marketing e IT."
msgstr "Three phases. Operational output for marketing and IT."

